{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/millennium-atria-deyaar-development-business-bay","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":387,"crm_id":"1933","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Millennium Atria","slug":"millennium-atria-deyaar-development-business-bay","display_address":"Business Bay","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Deyaar Development","price":1369708,"display_price":"1.36M","lattitude":25.1798483,"longitude":55.2636951,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Millennium Atria Business Bay, a 30-storey development by developer Deyaar Properties, is located in Dubai's dynamic cosmopolitan Business Bay district.</p><p>The project includes a tower with hotel apartments and a residential tower, which are united by a common podium. The stepped facade, highlighted by a bright color design, attracts attention and blends harmoniously into the surrounding space.</p><p>Adjacent to the iconic Burj Khalifa Tower and located next to the Business Bay Canal, the property is guaranteed to enjoy amazing views of Dubai.</p><p>Fully furnished <strong>studios, 1-3 bedroom premium apartments</strong> and luxury duplexes are available for buyers and investors. The interiors of the apartments have their own style, designed by the famous architectural studio YOO. The idea is based on a combination of functionality and sophistication of urban style.</p><p>For maximum comfort of Millennium Atria Business Bay residents there are such amenities as: infinity pool with panoramic views of Burj Khalifa Tower and Business Bay as a whole, modern gym, luxurious spa, gourmet restaurants, stores of world brands. Security and comfort of the residents are ensured thanks to the “smart home” technology, which is equipped with all apartments of the complex.</p><p>A great location close to Dubai's iconic attractions will allow you to reach Dubai Mall and Burj Khalifa Tower in just 5 minutes, while Dubai International Airport can be reached in just 25 minutes.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/1933/images/2024/05/16/15PE6l7NCmVpl0fV5hRzX1yJjSRBpm0qDnsVOEuV.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/05/16/15PE6l7NCmVpl0fV5hRzX1yJjSRBpm0qDnsVOEuV.png","__ggfxIndex":0}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2735,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/05/16/uQcHotTOqGCv00rJovamDSkrQvDmyYMPRPFK1zfJ.pdf","file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Brochure_fc07755b73.pdf","hash":"Brochure_fc07755b73","name":"Brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":null,"floor_plans":[{"id":2513,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom premium Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2514,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom premium Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2515,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom premium Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":2516,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"Studio","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"","payment_plans":[],"community":"Business Bay","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[],"bitrix":{"id":969,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Millennium Atria","tower_name":n